 e the regular non-senior schedule\; CHS and FWHS seniors finish May 14. Sc
 hool-specific graduation and baccalaureate ceremonies are separate milesto
 nes\, including CHS ceremonies after the final class day. Summer reading c
 amp and secondary credit recovery are separate programs.
